{"id":"wb-6-321","name":"静志寺塔基地宫","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"静志寺塔基地宫","text":"静志寺塔基地宫位于中华人民共和国河北省定州市，原为静志寺塔基下的地宫。地宫建于宋太平兴国二年。1969年5月电力公司施工时发现了这座地宫，同年7月定县博物馆对地宫进行了清理工作。地宫出土了大量珍贵文物，包括一批北宋定窑瓷器。已列为全国重点文物保护单位","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9D%99%E5%BF%97%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94%E5%9F%BA%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%AB","revisionId":87587752,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87587752","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/94db2fc4ef01b3f028a0ad76.jpg","title":"Dingzhou_Jingzhisi_Tajidigong.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dingzhou_Jingzhisi_Tajidigong.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7c/Dingzhou_Jingzhisi_Tajidigong.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Acot一杯茶","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​静志寺塔基地宫文保牌","width":320,"height":212}}